{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":34471935,"ns":0,"title":"Arithmetic zeta function","extract":"In mathematics, the arithmetic zeta function is a zeta function associated with a scheme of finite type over integers. The arithmetic zeta function generalizes the Riemann zeta function and Dedekind zeta function to higher dimensions.","description":"Type of zeta function","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}